1
00:06:28,235 --> 00:06:34,235
Tuesday is a fantasy, drama film directed by Daina Oniunas-Pusić.

2
00:12:56,470 --> 00:13:02,470
A mother and her teenage daughter must confront Death when it
arrives in the form of an astonishing talking bird.

3
00:19:24,705 --> 00:19:30,705
Zora, played by Julia Louis-Dreyfus.

4
00:25:52,941 --> 00:25:58,941
Tuesday, played by Lola Petticrew.

5
00:32:21,176 --> 00:32:27,176
Death, played by Arinzé Kene.

6
00:38:49,411 --> 00:38:55,411
Nurse Billie, played by Leah Harvey.

7
00:45:17,647 --> 00:45:23,647
Spike, played by Jay Simpson.

8
00:51:45,882 --> 00:51:51,882
Willow, played by Ellie James.

9
00:58:14,117 --> 00:58:20,117
Tuesday is a 2023 fantasy drama film written and directed by Daina O.

10
01:04:42,352 --> 01:04:48,352
Pusić in her feature directorial debut.

11
01:11:10,588 --> 01:11:16,588
A co-production between the United Kingdom and the United States, the film stars Julia Louis-Dreyfus and Lola Petticrew as a mother and daughter
who are guided by Death in the form of a size-altering macaw in coping with the daughter's impending death from a terminal illness.

12
01:17:38,823 --> 01:17:44,823
Leah Harvey and Arinzé Kene also star.

13
01:24:07,058 --> 01:24:13,058
Tuesday had its world premiere at the 50th Telluride
Film Festival on 1 September 2023.

14
01:30:35,294 --> 01:30:41,294
The film was released in North America in June 2024, and
in the United Kingdom on 9 August 2024.

15
01:37:03,529 --> 01:37:09,529
It received generally favourable reviews from critics.

16
01:43:31,764 --> 01:43:37,764
The tone is emotional.
